---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PricingCalculator from '../../components/PricingCalculator.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="商业合作模式与售前实施路径 | EU DPP Provider"
  description="欧盟新电池法 (EU 2023/1542) 结构化商业合作与交付模式：欧洲主权云订阅制 vs 企业私有化整包交付。清晰透明的 4 步极简售前与上线流程。"
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">商业合作与技术交付架构</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        两大企业级交付模式 <br />
        <span class="text-cyan-600">& 4 步极简合规落地路径</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        每家电池制造企业的产线自动化程度、ERP 架构与出口计划各不相同。我们提供灵活、严谨且权责分明的双重交付模式，精准匹配您的数据主权与项目预算要求。
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Dual Commercial Models Comparison Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Model 1: Managed Sovereign Cloud Subscription -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between border-t-4 border-cyan-600 relative">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono font-bold bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
            合作模式 A · 开箱即用主权云
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">
            欧洲主权云托管订阅制 (SaaS)
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-normal">
            适合希望快速打通欧盟市场、零海外 IT 运维负担的动力电池与轻型电池出海企业。
          </p>

          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 mb-6 space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">标准交付范围与服务承诺：</div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-cyan-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>10 年主权数据托管：</strong>德国法兰克福 Tier-IV ISO 27001 机房，保障 99.9% 稳定可用。</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-cyan-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>持续法规补丁升级：</strong>伴随欧盟后续授权法案与标准变动，全自动同步字段模型。</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-cyan-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>ZKP 零知识证明脱敏：</strong>保护核心正负极化学配方与商业采购成本不外泄。</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-cyan-600 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>GS1 全球秒级解析：</strong>全球 CDN 边缘节点 & eIDAS 2.0 电子印章数字签名。</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4 pb-4 border-t border-slate-200">
            商务结构：<strong>年度云托管订阅费 + 规格导入费</strong>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/zh/contact/?pref=subscription"
            class="neo-btn-primary block w-full text-center text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold"
          >
            <span>获取主权云方案与报价单 →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Model 2: Enterprise On-Premise Turnkey Suite -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between border-t-4 border-slate-800 relative">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono font-bold bg-slate-200 text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
            合作模式 B · 私有化整包交付
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">
            企业私有化整包部署 (On-Premise)
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-normal">
            专为超大规模电池超级工厂（Gigafactory）与主机厂打造，数据完全驻留于企业自有私有云内。
          </p>

          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50/80 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 mb-6 space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-1">标准交付范围与服务承诺：</div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>平台软件永久/集团授权：</strong>全套合规计算引擎与解析中间件私有化部署。</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>深度产线集成：</strong>只读打通工厂 MES、ERP (SAP/用友) 及 BMS 云端遥测数据。</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>数据清洗与初始化：</strong>资深合规工程师协助将历史物料 BOM 映射至 71 项标准字段。</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 text-slate-700">
              <span class="text-slate-900 font-bold">✓</span>
              <span><strong>团队培训与联调验收：</strong>现场合规操作培训、第三方认证机构联调与交钥匙验收。</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4 pb-4 border-t border-slate-200">
            商务结构：<strong>平台软件授权费 + 定制实施集成费</strong>
          </div>
          <a
            href="/zh/contact/?pref=onprem"
            class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white block w-full text-center text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold shadow-md transition-all hover:scale-[1.01]"
          >
            <span>获取私有化方案与技术白皮书 →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- 4-Step Pre-Sales & Onboarding Journey -->
    <div class="mb-20 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-2">清晰透明的售前落地旅程</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          4 步极简售前与项目交付流程
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-2">
          从前期合规差距诊断到最终欧盟注册簿联调放行，我们提供全程专家护航，确保项目周期可控、结果可验收。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="neo-surface p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm mb-4">
              01
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">合规差距诊断</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              梳理现有电池物料 BOM、供应链上游数据源与 LCA 碳排放记录，对照欧盟 71 项强制字段出具差距分析。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-800">
            周期：第 1–2 周
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="neo-surface p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm mb-4">
              02
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">架构与接口界定</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              明确交付模式（主权云托管或私有化部署），界定工厂 MES/ERP 系统只读接口范围与安全网闸方案。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-800">
            周期：第 3 周
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="neo-surface p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-800 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm mb-4">
              03
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">清洁区清洗映射</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              在境内安全清洁区完成核心数据脱敏与 ZKP 凭证生成，配置法兰克福主权沙盒测试节点。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-800">
            周期：第 4–6 周
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="neo-surface p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-green-100 text-green-800 flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-sm mb-4">
              04
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-2">注册簿联调与量产</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal">
              向 DG GROW 欧盟注册簿预核验 UPI，签发 eIDAS 2.0 电子印章，完成产线二维码激光蚀刻与交钥匙交付。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-green-800">
            状态：正式交付放行
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Architecture & Scoping Configurator Section -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-2">售前自助方案选型工具</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
          交互式方案选型与技术范围配置器
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 mt-2">
          点选您工厂的实际参数，系统将自动生成定制化的技术范围清单与商务方案获取通道。
        </p>
      </div>

      <PricingCalculator />
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
